{"pageProps":{"story":{"name":"Dachser Design System Umsetzung","created_at":"2024-12-13T09:30:00.808Z","published_at":"2025-07-07T15:57:59.000Z","updated_at":"2025-01-27T13:52:47.562Z","id":595249196,"uuid":"0065cf81-28f4-490a-adfe-d65ed81424a9","content":{"_uid":"0a50eb47-353c-43a7-93b9-c65698e87178","type":"page","section":[{"_uid":"3f8384e6-fc83-4ef2-b034-480168480b93","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"c7a241aa-3cdc-4b54-ad8c-ba568a0e2694","text":"Das Familienunternehmen DACHSER ist das drittgrößte Logistikunternehmen in Deutschland und weltweit unter den größten 15 Logistikern. Mit über 30.000 Mitarbeitern in 44 Ländern arbeitet DACHSER stets an der Verbesserung der Lieferkette, physisch sowie digital. \n\nMit dem digitalen Design System wurde für die Kunden und Partner von DACHSER ein Länderübergreifender und einheitlicher Markenauftritt für digitale Systeme geschaffen.\n\n---\n","type":"text","align":"center","layout":"singleColumn","component":"text","highlightText":false}],"spaceAfter":"small","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"Technische Umsetzung des digitalen Design Systems","content_align":"center","content_width":"narrow","headerSpacing":true,"headline_text":"Dachser","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":true,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"center","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"2200d8d2-0860-45f2-9c33-58cf20cc3662","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"b0bc5608-da41-43c4-99d5-dde0a5ccae3b","stat":[{"_uid":"74bfef2c-76cb-4ccb-b504-95b0bb4293a8","type":"stat","title":"Corporate Website","number":"1","component":"stat","description":""},{"_uid":"c0a780fa-1b3b-43c8-ba49-54c8633e87d8","type":"stat","title":"Plattformen","number":"2","component":"stat","description":""},{"_uid":"fde5cbcc-72e5-4587-9e9e-40229d57972d","type":"stat","title":"Landingpages","number":"33","component":"stat","description":""},{"_uid":"6b25cd25-58e3-4311-8be3-279b96d8a471","icon":"","type":"stat","title":"Länderwebseiten","number":"39","component":"stat","description":""}],"type":"stats","component":"stats"}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"small","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"21bbd375-adee-429f-843b-7b47fa855e4b","type":"section","style":"boldTransition","width":"full","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"","_uid":"6cd9a90c-d8b3-43cc-b327-2d9a74c4d005","text":"","type":"hero","height":"fullImage","buttons":[],"overlay":false,"textbox":false,"headline":"","component":"hero","image_alt":"","colorNeutral":false,"image_indent":"","textPosition":"","highlightText":true,"image_srcMobile":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/2048x893/0d4db9d672/dachser-visual_01.png","image_srcTablet":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/2048x893/0d4db9d672/dachser-visual_01.png","image_srcDesktop":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/2048x893/0d4db9d672/dachser-visual_01.png"}],"spaceAfter":"none","spaceBefore":"none","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"29814330-127c-4d51-99d6-668eacb86d9f","type":"section","style":"","width":"full","buttons":[],"inverted":true,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"Logistik, konsistent gedacht","_uid":"bd0e55be-d457-4d1c-82cc-e8d0190c2188","text":"Durch die internationale Ausrichtung und Größe des Familienunternehmens war es schwierig eine gleichbleibende Konsistenz im Markenauftritt über alle Länder hinweg zu wahren. Neben der Konsitentz sollte die Lösung flexibler, skalierbar und erweiterbar für die Zukunft sein. Bei der Entwicklung neuer Erweiterungen und Anpassungen wollte DACHSER deutlich an Geschwindigkeit zu nehmen.","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"Die Herausforderung","component":"cta","fullWidth":false,"image_alt":"","textAlign":"center","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"","highlightText":true,"image_padding":true,"backgroundColor":"#0b3d91","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":true},{"sub":"","_uid":"54bb8233-2952-4202-9fc9-f57944c491df","text":"In Zusammenarbeit mit unserem Partner Radikant haben wir ein digitales Design System entwickelt. Dieses stellt sämtliche Frontend-Komponenten in einem Patternlab dynamisch bereit. Das System ist nach dem Atomic Design Prinzip aufgebaut. Alle Elemente des Frontends bauen somit aufeinander auf und sind untereinander kombinierbar.","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"Lösung und Vorgehen","component":"cta","fullWidth":false,"image_alt":"Illustration des Atomic Design Prozesses","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/614x476/06337be278/atomic_sqr.svg","textAlign":"left","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"center","highlightText":true,"image_padding":true,"backgroundColor":"#0b3d91","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":true},{"sub":"","_uid":"7e0ee541-3d41-437a-86c0-9b1ebe1dab10","text":"DACHSER profitiert nun von einer zukunftssicheren Lösung, die es ihnen ermöglicht, mit den sich ständig ändernden Anforderungen des Marktes Schritt zu halten und gleichzeitig eine konsistente Markenpräsenz aufrechtzuerhalten.\n\n**1 Corporate Website**  \n**2 Plattformen**  \n**33 Landingpages**  \n**39 Länderwebseiten**","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"Outcome","component":"cta","fullWidth":true,"image_alt":"Verschiedene Screenshots der Dachser Webseite in einem Layout zusammengestellt","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/960x795/4a493520bf/dachser-screenshots-composed.png","textAlign":"left","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"center","highlightText":true,"image_padding":true,"backgroundColor":"#0b3d91","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":false}],"spaceAfter":"none","spaceBefore":"none","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"","content_align":"","content_width":"","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"none","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"52b4584f-97f1-4604-b795-abfaf72ec91a","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"","_uid":"4d94e53e-6014-49ab-9690-e4ea4af3958f","text":"Das Ergebnis ist ein flexibles und skalierbares Designsystem, das DACHSER nicht nur hilft, ihre Markenidentität zu stärken, sondern auch den gesamten Entwicklungsprozess optimiert. Die schnelle Bereitstellung neuer Seiten und Funktionen hat die Time-to-Market erheblich verkürzt. \n\nZudem konnten die Marketing- und Entwicklungsteams nun effizienter zusammenarbeiten, was zu einer höheren Produktivität und einer verbesserten Nutzererfahrung führt.","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"Impact","component":"cta","fullWidth":true,"image_alt":"Exemplarische Vorschau von verschiedenen UI-Komponenten aus dem Dachser Design System","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1920x1544/408093ca9f/dachser-atomic-design.webp","textAlign":"left","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"center","highlightText":true,"image_padding":true,"backgroundColor":"","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":true}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"52add920-07c4-47fa-bff0-6bbc3fd82b7f","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"0476414f-5a89-4d92-8c83-79fe2be94d75","text":"**Industrie & Branche**\n\n- Logistik\n- Global\n\n--- ","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"","highlightText":true},{"_uid":"6bda06ca-221d-412d-89c8-294349ad4049","text":"**Design System Services**\n\n- Technische Konzeption \n- Frontend-Entwicklung  \n\n---","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"","highlightText":true},{"_uid":"1f5aff21-1426-4a85-9ba3-300fdf6aed90","text":"**Technologien**\n\n- HTML & CSS, BEM\n- Patternlab\n\n---","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"","highlightText":true}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"none","content_mode":"","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default"},{"_uid":"5623e34f-5a2e-4b65-b60b-6b0c8d78f1df","type":"section","style":"accentTransition","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"ba8f3135-0df8-4abe-81ab-81c550202adb","type":"testimonials","layout":"slider","component":"testimonials","testimonial":[{"_uid":"7336b1f1-d6e0-4907-86d2-5067ed69cf9e","name":"Stephan Weiß","type":"testimonial","quote":"Als einer der größten deutschen Logistiker haben wir in der digitalen Welt an Geschwindigkeit zugelegt – mit einem skalierbaren und effizienten digitalen Design System, dass Radikant und ruhmesmeile entwickelt haben.","title":"– Department Head Digital Media bei DACHSER SE","rating":"","component":"testimonial","image_alt":"Dachser Logo","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1100x380/a434785483/dachser.svg"}]}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"none","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"left","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"b19da042-3fac-4629-9284-79eeb7d0584b","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"b67b0164-f1a1-4990-9e90-846dc7feccae","text":"","type":"teaser-card","image":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1080x811/cb3a55f5c8/hpp-teaser_01.jpg","label":"","layout":"row","target":"case-studies/hpp-architekten-website-relaunch","headline":"HPP Architekten Website Relaunch","component":"teaser-card","imageRatio":"unset","button_label":"Zum Showcase","button_hidden":true,"button_chevron":false},{"_uid":"cfa739eb-8987-42f2-a658-186e3a39aaf3","text":"","type":"teaser-card","image":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1080x810/75a4143d37/wolfcraft_teaser_4zu3.jpg","label":"","layout":"row","target":"case-studies/wolfcraft-cms-website","headline":"Wolfcraft CMS Website Relaunch","component":"teaser-card","imageRatio":"square","button_label":"Zum Showcase","button_hidden":true,"button_chevron":false},{"_uid":"7793fd7b-593f-414a-a902-80d0110e7446","text":"","type":"teaser-card","image":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1080x810/e6634e2b94/lughausen_teaser.png","label":"","l